          "path": "_m/u/8/p/3/kazantip-wp/my-church-where-i-heal.jpg",
          "filename": "This is my church (2006-08-108) (327847300).jpg",
          "caption": "This is my church. This is where I heal my hurts. It's a natural grace of watching young life shape. It's in minor keys solutions and remedies. Enemies becoming friends when bitterness ends. This is my church.\n\nThis is my church. This is where I heal my hurts. It's in the world I become contained in the hum between voice and drum. It's in the change the poetic justice of cause and effect. Respect, love, compassion. This is my church. This is where I heal my hurts. For tonight God is a DJ.",
